ACOPY,	DECODE			/GET THE INPUT DEVICE AND BLOCK NUMBER.
	CINPUT			/FROM THE COPY INPUT CRAP.
	TAD	FTYPE		/GET THE REPLY
	TAD	M314		/IS IT AN L (THE ONLY LEGAL DEVICE)
	SZA CLA
	JMP	ACOPY		/NOPE. REDISPLAY MESSAGE.
	TAD	FUNIT
	AND	L7		/MAKE SURE ITS A TAPE.
